    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1434">

                <pb facs="1538" n="1524" xml:id="pg1524"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">103.9169 Lima: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >White</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-16T20:00:00-04:00">May 16, 1944—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>517. From FEA,<anchor n="58" xml:id="d1434-f1"/> for Libbey.<anchor n="59"
                        xml:id="d1434-f2"/> Detailed proposals regarding Peruvian Overall Agreement
                    follow in few days by letter. However, general terms we propose are as follows: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Extension without specific termination date but cancellable on three
                            months’ notice.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>USCC<anchor n="60" xml:id="d1434-f3"/> entitled to change quantities
                            to be purchased or prices to be paid for copper, lead and zinc on three
                            months’ notice.</item>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>Mercury, tungsten, molybdenum, antimony to be dropped from
                            agreement.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>We invite your comments following receipt of details in our letter. [FEA.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1434-f1" n="58" xml:id="d1434-f1-content">
